Pre Focal Plane Scripts
-----------------------

    cassetteCheckout.asm
    cassetteCheckout.scr  Cassette device basic functionality test script
 cassetteErrCheckout.scr  Cassette device error test script
   extractorCheckout.asm           
   extractorCheckout.scr  Extractor device functionality test script
extractorErrCheckout.scr  Extractor device error test script
        gripCheckout.asm
        gripCheckout.scr  Grip device functionality test script
         icdCheckout.scr  Comprehensive mask assembly test script
			- Test Initialization function
			- Test Index Function
			- Execute the Test Function
			- Try entering invalid mask ID attributes
			- Try entering invalid mask location attributes
			- Try entering invalid park location attributes
			- Stopping UPDATE sequence in progress
			- Do an UPDATE and allow it to complete
			- Insert first mask from lookup table - an IFU
			- Re-load the same mask
			- Removing current mask
			- Mess up a re-load by moving the gripper first
			- Reloading the current mask
			- Loading a mask (last entry in table)
			- Start to load 1st mask then stop it
			- Parking function test
			- Now ask for current mask moved out to un-park assembly
        maskCheckout.asm
        maskCheckout.scr  Mask assembly functionality test script
			- Test Initialization function
			- Test Index Function
			- Test index at both ends with IFU in tow
			- Test index at both ends with mask in tow
			- Insert first mask from lookup table - an IFU
			- Loading a mask (last entry in table)
			- Parking function test
     maskErrCheckout.scr  Mask assembly error test script
   maskNoIfuCheckout.scr  Mask assembly functionality test script
                        - same as maskCheckout but skips the parts involving 
                          an IFU
     releaseCheckout.asm
